title: "Decision-focused learning for residential battery control: code and processed data"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code, trained checkpoints, processed Ausgrid household panel, network models and
  result records for a study of when decision-focused learning adds value to residential
  battery control, including its private-cost and AC feeder consequences.
